Hi

since the precision matrix is just a random scaling of a constant
matrix, you can simply use the generic model. I think this is what they
did here:

http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/env.1065/abstract

you might also need to define constraints, but it should be described in
the paper.

